          "solutionText": "গতিশক্তি ${E}_{{k}_{1}}=\\frac{1}{2}{m}_{1}{v}^{2}$ পরিবর্তিত ভর ${m}_{2}=3{\\text{ }m}_{1}$ এবং\nবেগ ${v}_{2}=3{v}_{1}$\n$\\begin{matrix} & ∴{E}_{{k}_{2}}=\\frac{1}{2}{m}_{2}{v}_{2}{}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}3{m}_{1}{(3{v}_{1})}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times{m}_{1}\\times{v}_{1}{}^{2}\\times27\\\\ & \\text{ বা, }{E}_{{k}_{2}}={E}_{{k}_{1}}\\times27\\end{matrix}$"
